    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person, point-and-click adventure set in a retro-futuristic, post-apocalyptic world where giant insects and abandoned robots reign supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/d68595fcc585507e506ecc69b260fdc6.poster.avif?t=1755250601\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/d68595fcc585507e506ecc69b260fdc6.webm?t=1755250601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/d68595fcc585507e506ecc69b260fdc6.mp4?t=1755250601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to explore and find your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/dedf4b48debb5aea2db7359997ca4c3f.poster.avif?t=1755250601\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/dedf4b48debb5aea2db7359997ca4c3f.webm?t=1755250601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/dedf4b48debb5aea2db7359997ca4c3f.mp4?t=1755250601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Combine specific items to create new ones in your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/58a2e37e0efa61d452c254c741b18c11.poster.avif?t=1755250601\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/58a2e37e0efa61d452c254c741b18c11.webm?t=1755250601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/58a2e37e0efa61d452c254c741b18c11.mp4?t=1755250601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Pick up items that can be used later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/ad73b46788a941562f212d658b94c16f.poster.avif?t=1755250601\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/ad73b46788a941562f212d658b94c16f.webm?t=1755250601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/ad73b46788a941562f212d658b94c16f.mp4?t=1755250601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/9f824f3684e2b46805ecf76763cea1a1.poster.avif?t=1755250601\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/9f824f3684e2b46805ecf76763cea1a1.webm?t=1755250601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/9f824f3684e2b46805ecf76763cea1a1.mp4?t=1755250601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive locations with realistic sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursor animations when hovering over hidden items in the scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicking on interactive objects displays a hand-drawn sketch illustrating the expected action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect objects to use later in other scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop items on specific spots to trigger actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic sequences triggered by player actions, advancing the story and unlocking new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine certain objects directly in the inventory to solve puzzles.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person, point-and-click adventure set in a retro-futuristic, post-apocalyptic world where giant insects and abandoned robots reign supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/d68595fcc585507e506ecc69b260fdc6.poster.avif?t=1755250601\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/d68595fcc585507e506ecc69b260fdc6.webm?t=1755250601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/d68595fcc585507e506ecc69b260fdc6.mp4?t=1755250601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to explore and find your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/dedf4b48debb5aea2db7359997ca4c3f.poster.avif?t=1755250601\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/dedf4b48debb5aea2db7359997ca4c3f.webm?t=1755250601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/dedf4b48debb5aea2db7359997ca4c3f.mp4?t=1755250601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Combine specific items to create new ones in your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301420/extras/58a2e37e0efa61d452c254c741b18c11.poster.avif?t=1755250601\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta