eractive objects displays a hand-drawn sketch illustrating the expected action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect objects to use later in other scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop items on specific spots to trigger actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic sequences triggered by player actions, advancing the story and unlocking new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine certain objects directly in the inventory to solve puzzles.</p></li></ul>",
